WEBVTT

00:21:26.598 --> 00:21:32.842
who have strong introvert feelings
for at least a good portion of the time.

00:21:32.866 --> 00:21:36.199
How can we be kinder to them?

00:21:36.223 --> 00:21:39.025
What are some of the things
that really, society,

00:21:39.049 --> 00:21:41.350
we need to raise our game on
and do better?

00:21:41.374 --> 00:21:47.301
SC: Well, first of all, I mean,
being kinder is great,

00:21:47.325 --> 00:21:50.063
and I guess I wish that were
enough impetus in general,

00:21:50.087 --> 00:21:52.221
but I'll give people
another framework, too.

00:21:52.245 --> 00:21:54.261
You know, we did one study of companies

00:21:54.285 --> 00:21:56.419
and found that the majority
of people believe

00:21:56.443 --> 00:21:59.505
that their organizations
are not harnessing the talents

00:21:59.529 --> 00:22:02.689
of the introverted half
of their workforces.